{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blade &amp; Dragon\u00a0VR is an epic action RPG game that combines intense sword combat with powerful magical abilities. Step into a fantasy world where ancient monsters like Dragons, Krakens, and other legendary creatures roam the land. As a brave warrior, your mission is to battle these fearsome foes, uncover hidden secrets, and grow stronger with every victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of swordplay through fast-paced battles that test your reflexes and timing. Learn and upgrade a variety of magical skills, each with unique effects and strategic uses. Whether you prefer unleashing fireballs or striking enemies with lightning, your powers will evolve as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies earns you gold, which can be used to purchase and enhance weapons, armor, and magical items. These upgrades unlock new abilities and improve your stats, making you even more powerful in combat. The deeper you go, the tougher the enemies\u2014but the greater the rewards.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802320?t=1754272540","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802320?t=1754272540","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802320/b25fc350c36f583b4201dcfb7a4a1011aa840b89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754272540","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802320/b25fc350c36f583b4201dcfb7a4a1011aa840b89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754272540","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blade &amp; Dragon\u